flowchart LR
  subgraph User
    A[Open Collection] --> B[Click 'Set paid price' on tile]
    B --> C{Valid value?}
    C -- no --> C1[Inline error] --> B
    C -- yes/empty --> D[Save]
    H[Open Dashboard] --> I[See invested, value, P&L, progress + Trending]
    J[Open card detail] --> K[Click 'Ver na LigaMagic']
  end
  subgraph System
    D --> E{PATCH ok?}
    E -- no --> E1[Show save error] --> B
    E -- yes --> F[Update tile + refetch portfolio summary]
    F --> G[Portfolio panel updated]
    K --> L{Stored fetched URL?}
    L -- yes --> M[Open exact Liga page of the price]
    L -- no --> N[Open Liga by same name used for price]
  end
  G --> H
